  "document": "Yellow Cab Pizza\nYellow Cab Pizza Company is a Filipino chain that retails fast food, primarily pizza. In 2001, Yellow Cab Pizza Company was founded by Eric Puno, Henry Lee, and Albert Tan. Max's Group, owner of restaurant chain Max's of Manila, owns the brand. The restaurant also operates 145 branches in Qatar, United Arab Emirates, and China."
